cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research package, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Geometry-Dependent Equilibria in Generalized Lennard-Jones-Type Power-Law Systems"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Mladenovski
    given-names: Toni
version: 0.1.2
date-released: 2026-11-11
repository-code: "https://github.com/eit-orbitos/EIT-LJ-Geometry"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible computational research package for geometry-dependent equilibrium
  radii in a generalized inverse-power repulsive/stabilizing force model, including
  polygon spectra, Platonic solids, controlled cuboid deformation, analytic large-N limits, rigorous geometry bounds, and boundary audits. Mixed licensing: code under PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0; manuscript/figures/documentation under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.
keywords:
  - Lennard-Jones
  - inverse-power potential
  - geometry
  - equilibrium
  - computational mathematics
  - reproducibility
